msgstr "Sarah se acercó a Varga antes de que pudieran llevárselo."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Varga, could we speak?"
msgstr "Varga, ¿podríamos hablar?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Varga waved away the soldiers, urging them to leave him be and turned to Sarah."
