msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Suddenly, three coins fell on the ground before her."
msgstr "De repente, tres monedas cayeron al suelo frente a ella."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He spoke some words she did not understand, and then turned to leave."
msgstr "Él dijo unas palabras que ella no entendió y luego se dio la vuelta para irse."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah stared at the money for a moment."
