msgstr "Y Sarah no tardó en acostumbrarse de nuevo. Le quedaba mejor para el papel que se esperaba que desempeñara ante su marido."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The house he bought her was small compared to the castle of her birth, but it was a respectable home in the small town of Northam."
