msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "But no scandal lasts forever, and before long, Sarah and Belmont's marriage was old news and the citizens began to treat them more kindly."
msgstr "Pero ningún escándalo dura para siempre, y al poco tiempo, el matrimonio de Sarah y Belmont ya era noticia vieja, y los ciudadanos comenzaron a tratarlos con más amabilidad."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah especially found a welcoming home in the town, managing to use her old talents of politicking to make her way into the social scene of the town."
