msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "They desired a lifetime but had only a night to themselves."
msgstr "Deseaban toda una vida, pero solo tenían una noche para sí mismos."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "So instead, they would try to fit a lifetime into tonight."
msgstr "Así que, en su lugar, intentarían encajar toda una vida en esta noche."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He finished inside of her. Between her legs. In her mouth. On her body."
