msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Perhaps you are right, and this world will not accept us out in the open..."
msgstr "Quizás tengas razón, y este mundo no nos aceptará si nos mostramos abiertamente..."

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
