msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "What would her people do if they knew? If they knew their princess, their queen, gave herself to an orc?"
msgstr "¿Qué haría su pueblo si lo supieran? ¿Si supieran que su princesa, su reina, se entregaba a un orco?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
