msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Look, where you from and why you're here, that's your story. I don't pry, you got your secrets, I got mine."
msgstr "Mira, de dónde vienes y por qué estás aquí, esa es tu historia. No me meto en eso; tú tienes tus secretos y yo los míos."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "But it's pretty clear nobody, you included, ever raised you for this."
msgstr "Pero está bastante claro que nadie, tú incluida, te preparó para esto."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "You got some smarts, and ya parents probably told you to make the most of that."
msgstr "Tienes algo de inteligencia, y tus padres probablemente te dijeron que la aprovecharas al máximo."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, there was no real point in denying that he was right."
msgstr "Sarah asintió; no tenía mucho sentido negar que él tenía razón."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Well, being smart is good when you're in a room full of other smart folk."
msgstr "Bueno, ser inteligente es útil cuando estás en una habitación llena de gente inteligente."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Everyone is polite, civil, and they all talk out their differences."
msgstr "Todos son educados, corteses, y siempre hablan para resolver sus diferencias."

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
