msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A knock on the door signalled food, and Sarah would retrieve it."
msgstr "Un golpe en la puerta anunciaba la comida, y Sarah iba a ir a buscarla."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The small gaps in the window, their only connection to the world outside."
msgstr "Las pequeñas aberturas en la ventana, su única conexión con el mundo exterior."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
